The diagram shows part of a tape measure, marked in centimetres.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,0) -- (5.5,0);
\foreach \x/\lbl in {0/40,1.1/42,2.2/44,3.3/46,4.4/48,5.5/50} {\draw (\x,0) -- (\x,0.3); \node[below] at (\x,0) {$\lbl$};}
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
What is the absolute error of this tape measure?
